{{ 'landingpage-service-section.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<div class="lp-service-section-wrap">
    <div class="page-width">
        <div class="section-title-intro-wrap">
            <h2 class="section-title">
                Choose your path <br>
                to the <i>perfect</i> office
            </h2>
            <div class="intro-dis">
                <p>
                    From on-brand styling to complete office fitouts, our tiered approach makes it easy to choose the level of support that suits your space, timeline and budget.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-col-wrap">
                <div class="service-col-inner-wrap">
                    <div class="service-col">
                        <picture class="service-img">
                            <img src="{{ 'service-img1.jpg' | file_img_url:'598x' }}" alt="Interior Designer" width="598" height="408" loading="lazy" >
                        </picture>
                        <div class="service-col-body">
                            <h3 class="service-title">Interior Designer</h3>
                            <div class="heading-line"><span>THE LOOK &amp; FEEL</span></div>
                            <div class="box-text-wrap">
                                <div class="box-text">
                                    <h4 class="box-title">What's Covered:</h4>
                                    <p>The aesthetics, furniture, styling, <br class="visible-sm"> soft finishes (look &amp; feel).</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="two-col-text-wrap">
                                <div class="col-left">
                                    <h5>Perfect For:</h5>
                                    <p>A space that needs styling with no structural construction, refreshing, rebranding, or moving office.</p>
            
                                    <h5>Key Result:</h5>
                                    <p>Receive a fully curated, brand-aligned decor package for the immediate delivery of an inspiring, high-performance working environment.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-right">
                                    <h5>Why Choose JasonL Design Studio?</h5>
                                    <h5 class="bg-heading">Ease & Efficiency.</h5>
                                    <p>
                                        JasonL Decor Packages deliver expertly curated, unboxed, placed, and styled solutions from multiple suppliers, saving your team hours of distraction while ensuring a professionally unmatched result.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="underline_list">
                                <h4 class="listheading">What's Included:</h4>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Furniture placement plan</li>
                                    <li>Style guide & mood boards</li>
                                    <li>Branded aesthetics</li>
                                    <li>Acoustics & soft furnishings solutions</li>
                                    <li>Furniture, material & colour palette schedules</li>
                                    <li>Guided JasonL and alternate supplier quotes</li>
                                    <li>Access to trade discounts</li>
                                </ul>
                                <a href="#interior-styling-section" class="morebtn-arrow-down btn">MORE INFO 
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="12px" height="14px">
                                    <path fill-rule="evenodd"  fill="rgb(255, 255, 255)" d="M10.226,6.417 L7.025,9.630 L7.025,0.472 L4.721,0.472 L4.721,9.462 L1.629,6.358 L-0.000,7.993 L5.957,13.972 L11.855,8.052 L10.226,6.417 Z"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-col-inner-wrap fitout-service-col-inner-wrap">
                    <div class="service-col">
                        <picture class="service-img">
                            <img src="{{ 'service-img2.jpg' | file_img_url:'598x' }}" alt="Fitout the structural build" width="598" height="408" loading="lazy">
                        </picture>
                        <div class="service-col-body">
                            <h3 class="service-title">Fitout</h3>
                            <div class="heading-line"><span>THE STRUCTURAL BUILD</span></div>
                            <div class="box-text-wrap">
                                <div class="box-text">
                                    <h4 class="box-title">What's Covered:</h4>
                                    <p>The build, fixed partitions, and all technical systems needed for code adherence and a build-ready foundation. (Technical, build-ready).</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="two-col-text-wrap">
                                <div class="col-left">
                                    <h5>Perfect For:</h5>
                                    <p>A space that needs internal layout changes, new leases, minor or major renovations, including expanding or downsizing.</p>
            
                                    <h5>Key Result:</h5>
                                    <p>Receive a fully documented, Build & Pricing Ready package for precision and delivering a seamless, cost-effective fitout.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-right">
                                    <h5>Why Choose Jasonl Design Studio ?</h5>
                                    <h5 class="bg-heading">Transparency &amp; control.</h5>
                                    <p>With over 15 years in the industry, we developed our fitout packages to address the lack of transparency and professionalism many SMEs face with traditional fitouts. By separating design and procurement, we create clear accountability between builder and client, guiding you to the right, reliable builder for your project.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="underline_list">
                                <h4 class="listheading">What's Included:</h4>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>All inclusions from Decor Package PLUS:</li>
                                    <li>Technical drawings & detailed build plans including demo, walls, furniture layout, and finishes</li>
                                    <li>Complete services integration (power, data, air-con/fire, plumbing, lighting, and custom joinery)</li>
                                    <li>Compliance assistance and/or authority approvals submissions</li>
                                    <li>Detailed scope of works & fitout budget forecasting</li>
                                </ul>
                                <a href="#fitout-price-table-section" class="morebtn-arrow-down btn">MORE INFO 
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="12px" height="14px">
                                    <path fill-rule="evenodd"  fill="rgb(255, 255, 255)" d="M10.226,6.417 L7.025,9.630 L7.025,0.472 L4.721,0.472 L4.721,9.462 L1.629,6.358 L-0.000,7.993 L5.957,13.972 L11.855,8.052 L10.226,6.417 Z"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
  {
    "name": "lp_service_section",
    "class":"lp_serivce_section"
  }
{% endschema %}